NODE id=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.GideonOpsPolicy.Evaluate kind=method
  digest=b3:fa5df2e5ddd35153301ed9bb3ec09c6bf795412c7dcfed6fb0ffcb7e89eab947 file=executor/cmd/mcl-execute/gideon_ops_policy.go range=177:230 lang=go exported=true byte_range=6530:8476
  sig=func (p *GideonOpsPolicy) Evaluate(toolName, host, command, service, prose string) OpsEvaluation
  doc=Evaluate applies the two hard guardrails to one tool call and returns\nthe verdict. Order matters: the validator hard-deny is checked first\n(host-based) so a destructive command against the validators that\ndoes NOT name them in prose is denied outright rather than gated.\n\nPure: no I/O, no state mutation — safe to call from any goroutine and\ntrivially unit-testable.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.GideonOpsPolicy
  ^defines=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute/gideon_ops_policy.go

