NODE id=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.SpendPolicyState kind=type
  digest=b3:e14c7aae8ea8db877b5bc0bbd482ece2e1d111e26449077c6fc755e09f53259d file=executor/cmd/mcl-execute/paxeer_spend_policy.go range=346:370 lang=go exported=true byte_range=13173:14055
  sig=type SpendPolicyState struct {\n	mu	sync.Mutex\n\n	// Circuit breaker.\n	violations	[]time.Time	// cap-violation timestamps within BreakerWindow\n	tripped		bool\n	trippedAt	time.Time\n	// cooldown is captured at trip time so IsTripped can self-heal\n	// without a back-reference to the policy (keeps state sidecar).\n	cooldown	time.Duration\n\n	// Per-recipient spend totals.\n	recipientSpend	map[string]*big.Int\n\n	// Rolling-window spend log.\n	windowSpend	[]spendEntry\n}
  doc=SpendPolicyState is the mutable, mutex-guarded runtime state for a\nPaxeerSpendPolicy. It tracks:\n  - breaker violation timestamps (sliding window) + tripped flag + time\n  - per-recipient spend totals (map[address]*big.Int)\n  - rolling-window spend log (timestamped amounts)\n\nAll access goes through the policy's EvaluateWithState / IsTripped\nmethods, which hold state.mu. Safe for concurrent use.
EDGES
  contains=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.SpendPolicyState#cooldown,matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.SpendPolicyState#mu,matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.SpendPolicyState#recipientSpend,matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.SpendPolicyState#tripped,matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.SpendPolicyState#trippedAt,matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.SpendPolicyState#violations,matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.SpendPolicyState#windowSpend,matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.SpendPolicyState.IsTripped,matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.SpendPolicyState.breakerCooldown,matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.SpendPolicyState.recordViolation
  ^defines=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute/paxeer_spend_policy.go

