NODE id=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.daemonState.handleGideonFleet kind=method
  digest=b3:d6ff1285b0482c4a3f331310c8ce82190081d38500105144ff617281785a2867 file=executor/cmd/mcl-execute/daemon_gideon_fleet.go range=45:110 lang=go exported=false byte_range=1517:3686
  sig=func (d *daemonState) handleGideonFleet(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request)
  doc=handleGideonFleet proxies GET /gideon/fleet → <GIDEON_FLEET_URL>/api/summary.\nThe upstream JSON body is streamed back verbatim with a 15s timeout. On\nupstream transport/HTTP failure the route returns 502 with a clear error\nso the panel can surface "telemetry source unreachable" distinctly from a\ndaemon fault.
EDGES
