NODE id=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.defaultCriticModel kind=const
  digest=b3:4be3b35c0963e8939e01c4343575ed9f12525844b1a7c782b5a04b7c1f6a2115 file=executor/cmd/mcl-execute/critique.go range=46:50 lang=go exported=false byte_range=2000:2350
  sig=untyped string
  doc=defaultCriticModel is Cassandra's non-reasoning grok pin used when neither\n-critic-model nor MATRIX_CRITIC_MODEL is set. It is deliberately NOT the\ngrok-4.3 registry default the executor/planner slots resolve to: the\ncompleteness audit runs on Cassandra's own non-reasoning model.
