  digest=b3:67d053436c930b8c23b6fab138a16259536e46d5fd932c191b32337f024bb580 file=executor/cmd/mcl-execute/synthesize.go range=915:972 lang=go exported=false byte_range=32412:33737
  sig=func extractOnBlockHints(mtxBytes []byte) (map[string]string, map[string]int)
  doc=extractOnBlockHints walks the SKILL.mtx AST once and harvests both\nflavors of on-block hint metadata in a single pass. Cheaper than\ntwo separate walks; the synthesizer always wants both (and any\nfuture hint kinds will fold in here).
