NODE id=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.histogramBucketsMs kind=var
  digest=b3:1c0b3c8b2ab0030fa26c8eaffb48e5693dfc7a9244b197e80d2e4a5e5d51cbe7 file=executor/cmd/mcl-execute/router_metrics.go range=89:98 lang=go exported=false byte_range=3236:3743
  sig=[]float64
  doc=histogramBucketsMs is the bucket upper-bound grid for routed-LLM\nlatency observations. Same shape as Prometheus's\nprometheus.DefBuckets but rescaled to milliseconds, with the upper\ntail extended to 60s to cover slow tool-augmented executor steps.\nSorted ascending; the synthetic +Inf bucket is implicit (every\nobservation lands at-or-below some bucket OR in the +Inf overflow).
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute/router_metrics.go

