NODE id=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.intentCostAccumulator.EmitTerminal kind=method
  digest=b3:2726736ef8e1e88188ffe0bf29c7a9268160e3a93c9cb0ed5bca326337057787 file=executor/cmd/mcl-execute/intent_cost.go range=201:221 lang=go exported=true byte_range=6963:7689
  sig=func (a *intentCostAccumulator) EmitTerminal(t *transcript)
  doc=EmitTerminal writes a single `intent.cost.summary` audit event with\nthe aggregated total. Called from the lifecycle driver on\nsuccessful terminal envelopes. Plan §5.11 also calls for a cortex\nEvent memory tagged "cost"; v1 emits the transcript event only,\nthe cortex write is staged for the next pass (cortex.Add wiring\ncrosses module boundaries that require additional plumbing).
