NODE id=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.routerMetrics.writePrometheus kind=method
  digest=b3:04702c9909d2e33aebdf2758724a6e807d4edd60efddb56f4d8c99bf15a892e6 file=executor/cmd/mcl-execute/router_metrics.go range=356:449 lang=go exported=false byte_range=11465:15589
  sig=func (m *routerMetrics) writePrometheus(w *strings.Builder, uptimeSec int64)
  doc=writePrometheus writes a Prometheus-compat text exposition of the\ncurrent metrics snapshot to w. Stable bucket-label set (le=...),\nstable label ordering, and HELP/TYPE preambles per series.\n\nSee https://prometheus.io/docs/instrumenting/exposition_formats/#text-based-format\nfor the wire format. Each metric:\n\n	# HELP <name> <description>\n	# TYPE <name> <kind>\n	<name>{labels} <value>\n\nCounters are monotonic uint64; histograms expose _bucket / _sum /\n_count families with stable label sets.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.routerMetrics
  ^defines=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute/router_metrics.go

