NODE id=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.synthesizeOpts#ContinuationNote kind=field
  digest=b3:880a1a0866ecc6aab8fcf7bd3b6567b3b265b3537b8a1be9003a427f01e8cc7e file=executor/cmd/mcl-execute/synthesize.go range=76:82 lang=go exported=true byte_range=2846:3289
  sig=string
  doc=ContinuationNote, when non-empty, marks this synthesis as a RE-PLAN\ndriven by the completeness critic (Phase 10.5). It is appended to the\nplanner user prompt and tells the model what already ran successfully\n(do not repeat) and which required items are still missing (plan only\nthose). Empty preserves the original single-shot planning prompt\nbyte-for-byte, so non-replan synthesis is unchanged.
