  sig=*main.routerMetrics
  doc=Optional per-route latency accumulator (Session 31d · P4).\nWhen non-nil, routed-LLM call sites push (slot, kind, model,\nstreamed, ms, err) observations through it; the accumulator\nthen surfaces aggregates via router.histogram events + the\ndaemon's /metrics endpoint. nil in tests + non-daemon CLI\nflows where the per-event audit fields are sufficient.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-execute.transcript

