  digest=b3:3c6c280400363307cea3518625c57dc8cecd6e7986cd4d746b7da39480bafbb0 file=executor/cmd/mcl-execute/daemon_profile_routes.go range=252:284 lang=go exported=false byte_range=7526:8799
  sig=func validateProfile(preferredName, agentName string, rawDomains []string) ([]string, string)
  doc=validateProfile enforces the input bounds and returns the normalized\nexpertise list (trimmed, empties dropped, case-insensitively deduped,\norder-preserving). A non-empty second return value is a plain-language\nvalidation error; callers MUST reject with 400 when it is set.
